ox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-translation"></use></svg>Translation</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Generative AI assisted the creation of translations.</p></div></div><div class="ai-detail"><div class="ai-detail__area"><span class="ai-detail__name"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-marketing"></use></svg>Marketing</span><span class="scope-pill"><span class="meter meter--some" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Partial</span></div><div><p>Generative AI assisted the creation of store images.</p></div></div></div><dl class="ai-facts"><div><dt>Not used, per the developer</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-live"></use></svg>In-game AI</span></span></dd></div><div><dt>Not mentioned</dt><dd><span class="muted-list"><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-audio"></use></svg>Music &amp; SFX</span><span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-voice"></use></svg>Voice</span></span></dd></div></dl><details class="disclosure"><summary><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="#i-chevron"></use></svg>Read the full disclosure<small>Quoted from the Steam store page</small></summary><blockquote><p>We used generative AI as an assistive tool to create in-game text and translations, 2D graphics, store images, and code. The game does not generate content with AI while running, and it does not send player input or personal information to AI services.</p></blockquote></details><div class="ai-label__foot"><div class="scope-legend"><span><span class="meter meter--core" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>Core</span><span><span class="meter meter--some" 